Description: Move axon_test_source.so out of the plugin scan path
 Moves /usr/lib/scifi/plugins/axon_test_source.so to
 /opt/scifi/data/quarantine/ to test whether its presence disturbs
 peripheral enumeration. Reversible by redeploying the original
 scifi-axon-test-source .deb. Touches nothing else.
